<h2>Frequently asked questions about Higgsfield and GenAI video creation</h2>
<h3>What is generative AI for video creation?</h3>
<p>It is the use of AI to generate or assist with video elements such as scripts, images, moving scenes and audio. A complete production workflow also includes human planning, editing and quality review.</p>
<h3>Can Higgsfield help me make AI micro-dramas and short films?</h3>
<p>Its cinematic controls and reference-based workflows can support scene creation for those formats. You still need a script, continuity checks and editing to turn individual generations into a coherent story.</p>
<h3>Do I need filmmaking experience to take this course?</h3>
<p>The course is listed at beginner level. Read the current prerequisites and outline to check that it fits your starting point and intended projects.</p>
<h3>Does registration include a free Higgsfield subscription?</h3>
